# Test of the Reformer (Q227), played by a level 39 Cleric who holds the Book of Reform and the
# Huge Nail already (the Nameless revenant and its Aruraune need a skill hit, which a traced scenario
# cannot play): Pupina sends it with the letter of introduction to Sla; Sla to Katari, whose
# inspector, pilgrim and betrayer this scenario kills at their fixtures and talks to; the Ol Mahum
# money and the greetings; Kakan sends it to the Crimson werewolf; Nyakuri to the Krudel lizardman;
# Ramus asks for the five bone fragments of the skeletons and the horror; Sla gives the Mark of
# Reformer. Katari, Kakan and Nyakuri call pilgrims, an inspector, a betrayer, a werewolf and a
# lizardman which the scenario cannot reach; the Boot tests play them.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
